## ⚠️ Warning! Its can be hard to turn this off, while you're in game!

This is cursed recource pack, where every text from the game is shuffled with another.

### Recource pack have 9 languages:
- English;
- Deauch;
- Spanish;
- French;
- Italian;
- Kazakh;
- Portuguese;
- Russian;
- Ukraian.

To get started just locate languages starting with `(Shuffled)` in language settings and select, which you want!

### Here how it will look like in language selection:
![Here how it will look like in language selection:](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bc060a99cee2af33898efcd8d5e7802ebf99e9a5.png)
